<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:5729432a4d5c690c24fd709adec30bca5e388a8238a866c69cd57c9f0207d712> <https://example.org/slice/text> "8. Keep the tide tables in pencil. The pans flood on the spring tide\nand hold their water for a week, and the week is not the same week in\nany two years; a table copied from an older table is a rumour, and a\nrumour repeated in ink is a fault that the next surveyor inherits from\nyou without ever learning that it was yours to begin with, which is\nthe whole reason that this guide is kept in the manner it is kept." .
<https://example.org/slice/unit:sha256:5729432a4d5c690c24fd709adec30bca5e388a8238a866c69cd57c9f0207d712> <https://example.org/slice/verse> "8"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
